as much with Special Snaps.</strong><br>Every time you discover a new event, you get a special snapshot! At any time during the game, you can enjoy comparative images and Japanese-English translations of the Japanese version of &quot;HEBEREKE&quot; and the Nordic version of &quot;Ufouria: The Saga&quot;. You can see how that scene in &quot;HEBEREKE&quot; looks like in &quot;Ufouria: The Saga&quot;...!<br>And the unique and expressive Hebe language in English translation! From core fans to international users, you can enjoy the story of &quot;HEBEREKE&quot; to the fullest. Two worlds with different characters and stories. Record every scene and discover the mystery of HEBEREKE. (Can you make it?)<br>The in-game menu is available in Japanese and English, but the main story of &quot;HEBEREKE&quot; is only in Japanese. Please enjoy the English translation at Special Snap.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869000/extras/be918f17fae024d3c85be7cbf521d2b5.avif?t=1771497339\" width=610 height=342 /></span><br><strong>2) Extra</strong><br>You can browse the package designs and instructions for the original versio of HEBEREKE.<br>You can also view the package design and instructions for the Nordic version of 'Ufouria: The Saga'.<br>(*Instructions can also be viewed from the menu in each game.)<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869000/extras/004ce0aaa2b7b60925b56eb1fa37d984.avif?t=1771497339\" width=610 height=342 /></span><br><strong>3) Achievements</strong><br>You can view all 35 achievements from the title screen.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869000/extras/c4897a080f88f7a07ad550f595519496.avif?t=1771497339\" width=610 height=342 /></span><br><strong>4) Ranking</strong><br>This is the mode to see how fast you can clear the game.<br>In Ranking, you can compete with users all around the world by total time and challenge to set a new record!<br><br><br><strong>\u2605About HEBEREKE</strong><br>HEBEREKE is a game developed by Sunsoft in 1991.<br>The main character, Hebe, is a little creature with a unique manner of speaking. The comical universe of the game and its cute characters are what made it so popular back then.<br>Another reason for its popularity is its action maze-like design. The player must explore every corner of the map to find their way in this surreal universe. The soundtrack is also to be mentioned: in contrast to the surreal world depicted, the music is more down-to-earth and straight to the point.","developers":["CITY CONNECTION"],"dlc":[2877330],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869000/header.jpg?t=1771497339","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a91991 SUNSOFT Developed and Published by 2024 CITY CONNECTION CO., LTD.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2869000/677757/8284822a992c3061e034704c5234bcbf7272e7a9/1750949064/dash_av1.mpd?t=1711094993","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2869000/677757/8284822a992c3061e034704c5234bcbf7272e7a9/1750949064/dash_h264.mpd?t=1711094993","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2869000/677757/8284822a992c3061e034704c5234bcbf7272e7a9/1750949064/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1711094993","id":257010065,"name":"HEBEREKE Enjoy Edition PV2","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257010065/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1711094993"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2869000/672437/e764c8e2d46391fb6e1fda78518140e11a821d26/1750949062/dash_av1.mpd?t=1710298118","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/s